 Mathematical objects and the 
\family typewriter
python
\family default
 types that carry them,
 by group:
 scalars,
 then finite products and collections,
 then maps.
 In mathematics every element is immutable and hence 
\family typewriter
Hashable
\family default
,
 so where a mutable and an immutable spelling both exist it is the immutable one that corresponds.
 Only the two marked rows are approximations rather than identifications.
